  "source_review": "Six exact protected python -c programs: process/cgroup metadata, own SQL SELECT diagnostics, fixed lifecycle JSON and filesystem metadata reads. No mutation request, shell, eval/exec, code from stdin, credential export or runtime override. Input JSON supplies source-name/hash assertions; it is not executed as code. Protected stream evidence binds program bytes and actor; it does not prove returned output or successful execution. Original ancestor two-stdin-program assumption remains distinct and unchanged."
